WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.400
-After the melodrama
over the suspected

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.968
Chinese spy balloon a week ago,

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:08.834
the U.S. has now shot down
three more unidentified objects

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.701
over North America that,
the White House said,

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:13.267
pose very real threats
to air traffic,

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:14.667
leading to wild speculation

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.133
about what those objects
could be

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.267
and, of course, criticism
from Republicans,

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:19.601
like Marjorie Taylor Greene.

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:21.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:25.567
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.634
Okay, guys, something very weird
is going on

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:30.033
[ Laughter ]
and, no, I'm not talking

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:32.400
about those ads for Jesus
during the Super Bowl.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:33.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:35.434
Jesus doesn't need to advertise

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:36.467
[ Laughter ]
during the Super Bowl.

00:00:36.467 --> 00:00:37.801
The guy gave one sermon,

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.767
on a mount, 2,000 years ago

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.601
and everybody's still talking
about it.

00:00:41.601 --> 00:00:42.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:43.434
You know who should charge

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:45.567
$7 million for a 30-second spot?

00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:46.434
Mounts.

00:00:46.434 --> 00:00:47.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.400
Also, please don't tell --

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:53.534
Also, please don't tell me

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.767
Jesus was advertising
his new streaming service

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:58.067
because I'm not sure
I can afford to get Messiah+

00:00:58.067 --> 00:00:59.834
[ Laughter and applause ]
while, at the same time,

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:01.667
I'm worried that I can't afford
not to.

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:04.033
[ Laughter ]
Now -- Plus,
now is not a good time

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.968
to launch a new streamer,
especially since you're going

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:07.801
to have to compete
with Satan's streaming service,

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:10.400
Tubi. Only
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.934
the devil himself

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:14.133
would think it's a good idea
to spend millions of dollars

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.868
to trick me into thinking
I sat on my remote.

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:19.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:22.033
Incidentally, the group that ran
those Jesus ads is tied

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:25.501
to efforts to curb LGBTQ rights
and ban medication abortion,

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:27.200
so, I guess, when they say...

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.300
the "us" has a big
old asterisk on it.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:32.667
[ Laughter ]
Anyway, the weird thing
that's been happening is

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:34.534
the skies over America
are suddenly turning

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:36.567
into that carnival game
Balloon Pop.

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:39.734
[ Laughter ]
Three mysterious objects have
been identified and shot down

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:41.534
over North American airspace
in as many days

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.501
and officials have
many more theories

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:44.901
than answers
about what's going on.

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.501
-The U.S. military shooting down

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:49.400
three mysterious flying objects
in just three days

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.367
and now the White House is
under growing pressure

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:53.100
to answer
some basic questions --

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:55.634
what are they,
where do they come from,

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:58.834
were these Chinese spy drones
or something else?

00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:00.601
-U.S. officials described it
as an...

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:06.300
and its...

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:08.634
While it wasn't considered
a military threat,

00:02:08.634 --> 00:02:09.834
the Pentagon says it had...

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:15.601
...and a top general says
they're considering all options.

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:16.868
-Not even the pilots,
apparently,

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.934
were really able to identify
what they saw.

00:02:18.934 --> 00:02:20.467
Those pilots, we have learned,

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:21.968
have given very
conflicting accounts

00:02:21.968 --> 00:02:23.467
of what they
actually experienced,

00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:26.267
with some pilots saying
that the object interfered

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:27.834
with the plane's sensors;

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.434
other pilots saying that they
didn't really experience that;

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:32.501
other pilots saying that,
when they looked at the object,

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:36.901
they could identify no
identifiable propulsion system.

00:02:36.901 --> 00:02:39.234
-Okay, wait, I'm sorry.
It was octagonal,

00:02:39.234 --> 00:02:40.701
it had strings hanging off it,

00:02:40.701 --> 00:02:43.367
[ Laughter ]
it it had no identifiable
propulsion system,

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:45.334
and it interfered
with the plane's sensors?

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:48.400
That sounds like what a stoner
who didn't see a UFO...

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:51.267
...would describe it as.

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:57.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.200
"There were strings."

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:02.100
As far as I can tell, there are
three possibilities here --

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.000
it's a foreign adversary spying
on us, it's aliens,

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.367
or there's a dude in Montana
with a remote control

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:10.234
in his hands, absolutely
[bleep] his pants right now.

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:13.901
[ Laughter ]
"Hey, honey, you have fun
flying your new drone?"

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:15.801
Actually, dear,
I realized that you were right

00:03:15.801 --> 00:03:17.601
and it is a dumb hobby,
so, I sold it.

00:03:17.601 --> 00:03:19.033
I sold it last week, in fact.

00:03:19.033 --> 00:03:21.534
Also, if anyone from the FBI
knocks on the door,

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:23.501
tell them you saw aliens
in the sky!

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:25.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:27.567
The details of what pilots
have seen in the skies

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:29.334
above North America
are just downright bizarre.

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:30.033
For example...

00:03:38.033 --> 00:03:40.667
I swear to God, if this is
a viral marketing campaign

00:03:40.667 --> 00:03:43.133
[ Laughter ]
for a Herbie the Love Bug
reboot,

00:03:43.133 --> 00:03:45.200
I am going to be psyched!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:48.033
I love me some Herbie.

00:03:48.033 --> 00:03:49.234
Sue me.

00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:50.267
[ Laughter ]
But I actually think

00:03:50.267 --> 00:03:52.133
the Volkswagen comparison
is a good thing.

00:03:52.133 --> 00:03:54.868
There's no better sign
aliens come in peace

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:56.667
than showing up
in a Volkswagen Bug.

00:03:56.667 --> 00:04:00.801
[ Laughter ]
They're probably hippie aliens
and long white ponytails.

00:04:00.801 --> 00:04:02.868
[ Laughter ]
And, if we talked to them,
they'd say --

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:06.567
[ Surfer voice ]
Hey, man, we're here to teach
you a new way to make water.

00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:07.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:07.734 --> 00:04:09.300
But do we listen?
No!

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:11.067
We just blow them
out of the sky

00:04:11.067 --> 00:04:12.801
while they utter
their final words --

00:04:12.801 --> 00:04:14.367
[ Surfer voice ]
Bummer, man!

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:16.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.467 --> 00:04:19.067
We were going to bring
the glaciers back.

00:04:19.067 --> 00:04:21.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.501 --> 00:04:24.200
In fact, the Air Force general
who's in charge of NORAD,

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.367
the military organization

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:26.801
that protects American
and Canadian skies,

00:04:26.801 --> 00:04:30.634
specifically, would not rule out
aliens when directly asked.

00:05:12.734 --> 00:05:13.667
-"Thanks"?

00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:16.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:19.000
Who -- I'm sorry,
the general in charge

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.634
of North American
Aerospace Defense

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:23.434
says there might be aliens
flying above us

00:05:23.434 --> 00:05:25.267
and there are just
no follow-up questions?

00:05:25.267 --> 00:05:26.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:26.267 --> 00:05:27.534
"Yeah, some people are saying

00:05:27.534 --> 00:05:29.200
that the aliens are here
and they intend

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.067
to enslave us underground
and steal our women.

00:05:31.067 --> 00:05:32.467
I'm not ruling anything out."

00:05:32.467 --> 00:05:33.868
Cool.
Thanks!

00:05:33.868 --> 00:05:36.234
[ Laughter ]

00:05:36.234 --> 00:05:37.701
That's how exhausted
journalists are

00:05:37.701 --> 00:05:39.567
from the past eight years
of nonstop crisis --

00:05:39.567 --> 00:05:41.434
psychotic president,
attempted coup,

00:05:41.434 --> 00:05:43.167
land war in Europe,
and a global pandemic.

00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:44.767
We hear about aliens
and we're all just like,

00:05:44.767 --> 00:05:47.067
"Alright, well, let us know
if the situation changes.

00:05:47.067 --> 00:05:48.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:48.767 --> 00:05:51.033
How much time we'd have
to evacuate and whatnot.

00:05:51.033 --> 00:05:53.067
I mean, sure would like it
to make it to the season finale

00:05:53.067 --> 00:05:54.200
of "Love Island"
before the old

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.467
wah wah wah wah, pkkkh!"

00:05:56.467 --> 00:05:58.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.701 --> 00:06:00.534
Now, it turns out
there's actually

00:06:00.534 --> 00:06:02.734
a much more mundane
potential explanation

00:06:02.734 --> 00:06:05.100
for why we're suddenly
finding more random stuff

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.501
floating in the skies above us.

00:06:06.501 --> 00:06:07.734
After the Chinese spy balloon,

00:06:07.734 --> 00:06:09.868
the military basically widened
their antenna

00:06:09.868 --> 00:06:11.934
to identify more objects
than they usually would.

00:06:11.934 --> 00:06:13.234
According
to The Washington Post...

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.734
"Also, if you're thinking
about buying a car,

00:06:33.734 --> 00:06:35.868
maybe wait a few weeks because,
based on what these objects

00:06:35.868 --> 00:06:37.901
turn out to be,
our roads may be obliterated."

00:06:37.901 --> 00:06:39.367
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.367 --> 00:06:40.334
Thanks!

00:06:40.334 --> 00:06:45.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:45.801 --> 00:06:47.400
Although, personally,
I would like to know

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.334
why are there filters,
in the first place?

00:06:49.334 --> 00:06:52.234
Shouldn't NORAD be able
to detect abnormal objects

00:06:52.234 --> 00:06:53.367
with surveillance capabilities?

00:06:53.367 --> 00:06:55.200
How many of these
have we missed, so far?

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.467
I mean, on one hand,
the explanation is a relief.

00:06:57.467 --> 00:06:59.133
On the other hand,
it feels like they're saying,

00:06:59.133 --> 00:07:00.367
"Don't freak out about this.

00:07:00.367 --> 00:07:01.601
They've been
in the skies forever.

00:07:01.601 --> 00:07:03.000
We just didn't notice them.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.567
Be they from China or outer
space, one thing is clear --

00:07:05.567 --> 00:07:08.000
they know every single [bleep]
thing about us by now."

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.534
[ Laughter ]

00:07:09.534 --> 00:07:12.300
So, obviously, it seems like
there are, very likely,

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.667
some less dramatic explanations
for the strange activity.

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.367
NORAD widened its filters,

00:07:16.367 --> 00:07:18.567
so, it's just detecting
more air traffic than usual.

00:07:18.567 --> 00:07:21.367
Or maybe it's a foreign
adversary spying on us

00:07:21.367 --> 00:07:24.067
in the way that all global
superpowers spy on each other.

00:07:24.067 --> 00:07:26.634
And maybe it's aliens. I mean,
it can't be a coincidence

00:07:26.634 --> 00:07:27.868
this happened the same week

00:07:27.868 --> 00:07:29.767
Senator Rick Scott was
in the news...

00:07:29.767 --> 00:07:31.367
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.367 --> 00:07:33.400
...for trying
to cut Social Security.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.801
[ Changes voice ]
Mother ship,
I need a distraction.

00:07:35.801 --> 00:07:38.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:38.367 --> 00:07:40.100
Release the Volkswagens.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.868
But I got to say -- I never
thought I would say this --

00:07:45.868 --> 00:07:48.100
This is one time I kind of wish
Donald Trump

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.667
was still president,
just for like one hour,

00:07:50.667 --> 00:07:54.601
[ Laughter ]
because, if it was aliens,
he would blurt it out instantly.

00:07:54.601 --> 00:07:55.634
[ Laughter ]

00:07:55.634 --> 00:07:57.501
I mean, can you
imagine the tweet?

00:07:57.501 --> 00:08:00.167
Everyone'd be like,
"Is it Russia? Is it China?"

00:08:00.167 --> 00:08:01.200
And Trump would be like...

00:08:03.567 --> 00:08:05.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.601
[ Laughter and applause ]
Also, I would give --

00:08:15.601 --> 00:08:18.133
I would give anything

00:08:18.133 --> 00:08:20.767
to hear Donald Trump say
the word extraterrestrial.

00:08:20.767 --> 00:08:23.701
[ Laughter ]
He'd do that thing
where he says it wrong

00:08:23.701 --> 00:08:25.000
and, instead
of correcting himself,

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.567
he would just say it right,
like both are acceptable.

00:08:27.567 --> 00:08:29.167
[ As Trump ]
The viderers -- the visitors

00:08:29.167 --> 00:08:30.934
[ Laughter ]
are extraterrustrial

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.467
and extraterrestrial.

00:08:32.467 --> 00:08:35.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:35.868 --> 00:08:38.000
If aliens are here
and we're [bleep], either way,

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.467
[ Laughter ]
just give me --

00:08:39.467 --> 00:08:41.067
just give me the Trump speech.

00:08:41.067 --> 00:08:42.601
[ As Trump ]
Good evening,
my fellow Americans --

00:08:42.601 --> 00:08:46.300
although, we won't be Americans
for long, I can't imagine.

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:48.167
I can't imagine maps are going
to be much --

00:08:48.167 --> 00:08:49.801
mean much in a couple of hours.

00:08:49.801 --> 00:08:51.234
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.234 --> 00:08:53.467
I come to you tonight
to say we've made contact

00:08:53.467 --> 00:08:56.634
with some extra--
Ooh.

00:08:56.634 --> 00:08:58.200
Extra bad guys.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:59.634 --> 00:09:00.634
They're from space.

00:09:00.634 --> 00:09:02.701
They're extra bad

00:09:02.701 --> 00:09:04.567
and they're not like
"Star Wars" aliens.

00:09:04.567 --> 00:09:07.467
And I would know, because I
visited Skywalker Ranch.

00:09:07.467 --> 00:09:10.400
[ Laughter ]
1982, I was with George Lucas

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.734
and his little trash can,
R2-MeToo.

00:09:12.734 --> 00:09:14.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:14.834 --> 00:09:16.901
And this very little guy came
up to me,

00:09:16.901 --> 00:09:19.200
walking up to me,
tough guy, strong guy,

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.000
[ Laughter ]
tears pouring
down his furry face,

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.968
and he said to me -- I said --
I'll never forget what he said.

00:09:23.968 --> 00:09:26.100
He said, "Mr. Trump, sir,
yub nub."

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:28.734 --> 00:09:30.801
Today, White House Press
Secretary Karine Jean-Pierre

00:09:30.801 --> 00:09:33.634
declared that it is
almost certainly not aliens.

00:09:33.634 --> 00:09:37.133
-There is no --
again, no indication of aliens

00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:39.167
or extraterrestrial activity

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:41.234
[ Laughter ]
with these recent takedowns.

00:09:41.234 --> 00:09:43.968
-Okay, but that's definitely
what the White House would say

00:09:43.968 --> 00:09:45.501
in a movie
about an alien invasion.

00:09:45.501 --> 00:09:47.934
[ Laughter ]
Thirty minutes later,
cut to Joe Biden

00:09:47.934 --> 00:09:50.667
personally fighting an alien
on the roof of the White House.

00:09:50.667 --> 00:09:52.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:52.334 --> 00:09:53.901
It would give Biden a chance
to utter one

00:09:53.901 --> 00:09:56.167
of those iconic
movie president lines.

00:09:56.167 --> 00:09:57.868
[ As Biden ]
Get off my stairs!

00:09:57.868 --> 00:10:01.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:03.534
[ Surfer voice ]
Hey, man! Cut it out!

00:10:03.534 --> 00:10:05.000
[ Laughter ]

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.534
We were trying to bring back
the polar bears.

00:10:07.534 --> 00:10:10.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:10.267 --> 00:10:12.200
So, the U.S. Air Force
has shot down

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.200
three identified objects
in as many days,

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:17.734
which, by the way, was exactly
what Republicans demanded

00:10:17.734 --> 00:10:19.100
when the Chinese
spy balloon floated

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.601
across American airspace
for a few days.

00:10:20.601 --> 00:10:21.934
They wanted it shot down
immediately.

00:10:21.934 --> 00:10:23.968
So, I guess, now that Biden
is taking their advice,

00:10:23.968 --> 00:10:25.701
they're going to line up
to congratulate him.

00:10:25.701 --> 00:10:27.634
And I'm just kidding.
They're whining, yet again.

00:10:27.634 --> 00:10:29.267
[ Laughter ]
-The American people
have seen Joe Biden

00:10:29.267 --> 00:10:30.467
in the first two years.

00:10:30.467 --> 00:10:32.667
He has failed to secure
the southern border.

00:10:32.667 --> 00:10:34.567
Now, they're beginning
to get concerned

00:10:34.567 --> 00:10:36.567
that he can't secure
our airspace.

00:10:36.567 --> 00:10:38.467
-It's a whole bunch
of radio silence,

00:10:38.467 --> 00:10:41.601
tap dancing, and equivocation
from the Biden administration.

00:10:41.601 --> 00:10:43.467
You know,
we shouldn't be surprised.

00:10:43.467 --> 00:10:44.567
Things have been a disaster

00:10:44.567 --> 00:10:46.534
since they took control
two years ago.

00:10:46.534 --> 00:10:48.267
-This administration
is refusing

00:10:48.267 --> 00:10:50.334
to say
what is happening.

00:10:50.334 --> 00:10:52.634
What are these objects?
What are these crafts?

00:10:52.634 --> 00:10:54.834
Who is directing them?
How are they getting here?

00:10:54.834 --> 00:10:56.067
What is their mission?

00:10:56.067 --> 00:10:58.634
-I think it shows our lack
of transparency

00:10:58.634 --> 00:11:01.100
by this administration.
You know, the first balloon,

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.033
they shot down after it had

00:11:03.033 --> 00:11:04.901
transversed
our entire country.

00:11:04.901 --> 00:11:06.801
They claimed it was for safety.

00:11:06.801 --> 00:11:09.968
And, obviously, they could've
dropped the thing in Montana.

00:11:09.968 --> 00:11:11.434
They would --

00:11:11.434 --> 00:11:13.133
They're more likely
to hit some guy

00:11:13.133 --> 00:11:16.567
with a mullet and a tank top
on Myrtle Beach

00:11:16.567 --> 00:11:18.767
[ Laughter ]
than they were to hit
somebody in Montana.

00:11:18.767 --> 00:11:20.834
[ Laughter ]
-Alright, first of all,

00:11:20.834 --> 00:11:24.734
if a guy with a mullet
and a tank top on Myrtle Beach

00:11:24.734 --> 00:11:26.367
did get hit with a UFO,

00:11:26.367 --> 00:11:29.100
I'm pretty sure that dude would
be [bleep] thrilled.

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.133
[ Laughter ]

00:11:30.133 --> 00:11:31.734
[ Southern accent ]
Whoa! All my exes

00:11:31.734 --> 00:11:33.234
are finally gonna believe me!

00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:34.534
[ Laughter ]
Hey, Barbara, it's Jared.

00:11:34.534 --> 00:11:36.901
Yo, did you see me on the news?!

00:11:36.901 --> 00:11:39.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:39.234 --> 00:11:41.033
Who's laughing now, Barbara?

00:11:41.033 --> 00:11:42.367
[ Laughter ]

00:11:42.367 --> 00:11:43.701
Why is Stephen Miller on TV

00:11:43.701 --> 00:11:45.167
talking about this,
or any subject?

00:11:45.167 --> 00:11:47.834
He sounds like the guy
from the sci-fi movie

00:11:47.834 --> 00:11:49.200
who would be in the Oval Office,

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.300
telling the president
to nuke the aliens immediately,

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:53.868
while a bunch of scientists beg
for more time.

00:11:53.868 --> 00:11:56.300
[ As Miller ]
We must nuke this unidentified
aircraft immediately,

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.434
in order to establish
American sovereignty

00:11:58.434 --> 00:12:00.567
and superiority
over our airspace.

00:12:00.567 --> 00:12:02.934
"Sir, we're pretty sure
it's just a birthday balloon.

00:12:02.934 --> 00:12:04.267
It has a Paw Patrol on it."

00:12:04.267 --> 00:12:06.934
[ Laughter ]
We must show the Paw Patrol

00:12:06.934 --> 00:12:09.000
that they are not the law
in this country. We are!

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.300
[ Laughter ]
The White House held a briefing
to offer more details today.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.167
But I will say, I wouldn't mind

00:12:14.167 --> 00:12:15.834
hearing a little more
from Biden.

00:12:15.834 --> 00:12:16.968
When he was asked
at the White House

00:12:16.968 --> 00:12:19.100
about the object shot down
over Alaska,

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:20.234
this is all he had to say.

00:12:26.667 --> 00:12:28.400
[ Laughter ]
That's it?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.701
Can you give us
a little more info?

00:12:29.701 --> 00:12:31.868
Unidentified objects are
getting shot down in the skies

00:12:31.868 --> 00:12:33.834
above the U.S.,
like a game of Duck Hunt,

00:12:33.834 --> 00:12:35.701
and Biden's playing it close
to the vest,

00:12:35.701 --> 00:12:37.067
like a grandpa
at a family reunion

00:12:37.067 --> 00:12:38.801
when grandma's recounting
how they met.

00:12:38.801 --> 00:12:40.234
"You know, your grandfather was

00:12:40.234 --> 00:12:41.934
quite the Casanova
back in the day.

00:12:41.934 --> 00:12:44.334
He took me out to Lovers' Cliff
in his Stingray."

00:12:44.334 --> 00:12:45.767
[ As Biden ]
Hey! That's not
for them to hear.

00:12:45.767 --> 00:12:47.167
Let's just say

00:12:47.167 --> 00:12:48.300
it was a success.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.634
[ Laughter ]

00:12:51.634 --> 00:12:54.267
The lack of concrete information
has left a vacuum

00:12:54.267 --> 00:12:55.901
for conspiracy nuts to run wild.

00:12:55.901 --> 00:12:57.634
For example, over the weekend,

00:12:57.634 --> 00:12:59.167
Earth's Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:12:59.167 --> 00:13:01.934
[ Laughter ]
listed off a bunch
of insane hypotheticals

00:13:01.934 --> 00:13:04.033
for what could've been
inside the Chinese spy balloon

00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:06.000
and recounted yelling
at military officials

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.634
during a congressional briefing
about it.

00:13:07.634 --> 00:13:11.067
-You sat by and allowed
this Chinese spy balloon,

00:13:11.067 --> 00:13:12.767
that could've contained
-Yep.

00:13:12.767 --> 00:13:15.434
-a bioweapon, like COVID.
-That's right.

00:13:15.434 --> 00:13:17.901
-It could've contained
a nuclear bomb,

00:13:17.901 --> 00:13:21.033
an EMP attack,
or hypersonic missiles.

00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:22.868
I said, "You allowed this
to go across the country

00:13:22.868 --> 00:13:24.067
and then you want
to stand up here

00:13:24.067 --> 00:13:26.667
and give us our excuses --

00:13:26.667 --> 00:13:29.534
your excuses --
on why you didn't shoot it down

00:13:29.534 --> 00:13:32.133
because you're
gathering intelligence

00:13:32.133 --> 00:13:35.701
or you didn't want to risk
endangering anyone's lives?"

00:13:35.701 --> 00:13:39.367
I said, "That is the biggest
bunch of bull[bleep]."

00:13:39.367 --> 00:13:42.300
-Yeah! The balloon could've
contained a nuclear bomb,

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.868
which is why you should've
shot a missile at it!

00:13:44.868 --> 00:13:46.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:13:46.934 --> 00:13:50.334
Everyone knows that's how you
safely disarm a nuclear weapon

00:13:50.334 --> 00:13:52.868
directly above a densely
populated area.

00:13:52.868 --> 00:13:53.934
[ Laughter ]

00:13:53.934 --> 00:13:55.934
Missiles cancel out
nuclear bombs,

00:13:55.934 --> 00:13:57.834
just like the reverse card
in UNO.

00:13:57.834 --> 00:14:01.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:01.133 --> 00:14:02.234
What else does she think

00:14:02.234 --> 00:14:03.601
could've been
inside this balloon?

00:14:03.601 --> 00:14:05.000
[ As Greene ]
There could've been bioweapons,

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.901
missiles, a nuclear weapon;
or, even worse,

00:14:06.901 --> 00:14:08.267
a bunch of middle school
textbooks

00:14:08.267 --> 00:14:10.300
that teach accurate history!

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:11.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:14:11.434 --> 00:14:12.767
So, it's a mysterious situation.

00:14:12.767 --> 00:14:13.868
We don't have any details.

00:14:13.868 --> 00:14:15.267
There's a bunch
of possible explanations.

00:14:15.267 --> 00:14:17.901
It's obviously quite unlikely
that it's aliens,

00:14:17.901 --> 00:14:19.567
although, if it is aliens,

00:14:19.567 --> 00:14:21.434
Republicans want them
shot down immediately,

00:14:21.434 --> 00:14:23.934
even if it means they land
on a farm in Montana,

00:14:23.934 --> 00:14:24.667
in the middle of a...

00:14:24.667 --> 00:14:28.267
-Bunch of bull[bleep].

00:14:28.267 --> 00:14:29.534
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:14:29.534 --> 00:14:34.000
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

